neighbor 0.0001 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check no
comm_modify cutoff 0.00045149999999999997
fix props all property/atom d_vfrac d_theta d_damage ghost yes
set group all d_vfrac 1.2500000000000002e-13
Setting atom values ...
  3488 settings made for d_vfrac
group clot type 1
1927 atoms in group clot
group anchors type 2
1561 atoms in group anchors
bond_style bpm/peri
pair_style bpm/peri contact_distance_factor 1.0
pair_coeff * * 3.7226771877469815e+20 0.0001505
bond_coeff 1 lps 33333.333333333336 940 0.0001505 0.14999999999999999 0
bond_coeff 2 lps 33333.333333333336 940 0.0001505 0.14062485937499999 0
bond_coeff 3 lps 33333.333333333336 940 0.0001505 1.0 0
velocity all set 0 0 0 units box
# Official BPM peri accumulates N/m^3: convert to nodal N BEFORE external forces.
variable si_fx atom fx*d_vfrac
variable si_fy atom fy*d_vfrac
variable si_fz atom fz*d_vfrac
fix si_force all setforce v_si_fx v_si_fy v_si_fz

fix wallprops all property/atom d_wclear d_wpen d_wtri ghost yes
fix nativewall clot external pf/callback 1 1
fix cfdload all external pf/callback 1 1
timestep 5e-7
compute contactPE all pe pair
compute bondPE all pe bond
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step atoms bonds ke c_contactPE c_bondPE
thermo_modify lost error lost/bond error
# No nve, no damping, no streaming or drag; anchor coordinates constrained by static optimizer.
# No anchor setforce: physical internal force is retained for reaction recovery.

run 0

